###  https://everythingisasign.com/ontology/eias-ontology#Basic_Formal_Ontology_2_0_Specification_and_User_s_Guide
:Basic_Formal_Ontology_2_0_Specification_and_User_s_Guide rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                   :Work ;
                                                          :introduction "This document is a guide for those using Basic Formal Ontology (BFO) as an upper-level (formal, domain-neutral) ontology to support the creation of lower-level domain ontologies" .


