###  https://everythingisasign.com/ontology/eias-ontology#Metaphysics
:Metaphysics rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                      :FieldOfStudyConcept ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> :Philosophy ;
